#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:1
msgid "Adding a New Local Model"
msgstr "添加新的本地模型"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:3
msgid ""
"Use this guide for a model served by an OpenAI-compatible server you run:"
" vLLM, SGLang, Ollama or your own `/v1/chat/completions` service. The "
"gateway sends chat requests to `/v1/chat/completions`, and embedding "
"requests to `/v1/embeddings` for a model with `model_type: embedding`. "
"For hosted providers, see [Adding a New Model](adding-models.md)."
msgstr ""
"本指南适用于由你自己运行的兼容 OpenAI 的服务器提供的模型：vLLM、SGLang、Ollama 或你自己的 "
"`/v1/chat/completions` 服务。网关把 chat 请求发到 `/v1/chat/completions`，对 "
"`model_type: embedding` 的模型则把 embedding 请求发到 `/v1/embeddings`。托管 provider"
" 见[添加新模型](adding-models.md)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:9
msgid "Step 1: Start the local model server"
msgstr "第 1 步：启动本地模型服务器"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:11
msgid "This guide registers the server as `kind: sglang`:"
msgstr "本指南把服务器注册为 `kind: sglang`："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:21
msgid ""
"For vLLM, run `vllm serve <hf-org>/<hf-model> --port 8007 --served-model-"
"name my-local-model`. All local kinds use `OpenAICompatAdapter`; the "
"`kind` sets the dashboard label and provider profile, so pick the one "
"that matches the runtime you started."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 vLLM，运行 `vllm serve <hf-org>/<hf-model> --port 8007 --served-model-"
"name my-local-model`。所有本地 kind 都使用 `OpenAICompatAdapter`；`kind` 决定仪表盘标签和 "
"provider profile，所以要选与你启动的运行时相符的那个。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:26
msgid ""
"Check the server before registering it. Local servers usually need no API"
" key:"
msgstr "注册之前先检查服务器。本地服务器通常不需要 API key："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:39
msgid ""
"A gateway in Docker reaches the host at "
"`http://host.docker.internal:<port>`; a gateway running directly on the "
"host uses `http://localhost:<port>`. For a server on another machine, see"
" [A server on another machine](#a-server-on-another-machine)."
msgstr ""
"运行在 Docker 中的网关通过 `http://host.docker.internal:<port>` "
"访问宿主机；直接运行在宿主机上的网关使用 "
"`http://localhost:<port>`。服务器在另一台机器上时，见[另一台机器上的服务器](#a-server-on-another-"
"machine)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:44
msgid "Step 2: Register the model"
msgstr "第 2 步：注册模型"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:46
msgid ""
"Create the model in **Admin → Routing → Create model** with a route to "
"the server; it applies at once. For aliases or other metadata, add an "
"entry to the `models` list of the model catalog (see [Where your model "
"registry lives](adding-models.md#where-your-model-registry-lives)) and "
"run `make restart s=backend` when Admin marks it **Restart required**:"
msgstr ""
"在 **Admin → Routing → Create model** "
"中创建模型，并添加一条指向该服务器的路由；它会立即生效。如需别名或其他元数据，在模型目录的 `models` "
"列表中加入一个条目（见[模型注册表在哪里](adding-models.md#where-your-model-registry-"
"lives)），并在 Admin 标记 **Restart required** 时运行 `make restart s=backend`："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:103
msgid "For a local server, check these fields:"
msgstr "对于本地服务器，请检查这些字段："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:105
msgid "`id`: the name clients send as `model`. Keep it short and stable."
msgstr "`id`：客户端作为 `model` 发送的名称。保持简短、稳定。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:106
msgid "`route[].kind`: `vllm`, `sglang`, `ollama` or `openai_compat`."
msgstr "`route[].kind`：`vllm`、`sglang`、`ollama` 或 `openai_compat`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:107
msgid ""
"`base_url`: the server root, with or without `/v1`; the adapter appends "
"`/chat/completions`."
msgstr "`base_url`：服务器根地址，带不带 `/v1` 都可以；adapter 会追加 `/chat/completions`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:109
msgid ""
"`provider_model_id`: the name the runtime serves (`--served-model-name`, "
"the Ollama tag)."
msgstr "`provider_model_id`：运行时对外提供的模型名称（`--served-model-name`、Ollama 标签）。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:111
msgid ""
"`supported_params`, `supports_tools`, `supports_structured_output`: only "
"what the runtime supports."
msgstr "`supported_params`、`supports_tools`、`supports_structured_output`：只写运行时真正支持的内容。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:113
msgid "`aliases`: must not collide with another model's `id` or aliases."
msgstr "`aliases`：不能与其他模型的 `id` 或别名冲突。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:115
msgid ""
"Every field is in the [Configuration Reference](adding-models.md"
"#configuration-reference)."
msgstr "全部字段见[配置参考](adding-models.md#configuration-reference)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:118
msgid "Naming a route in the dashboard"
msgstr "在仪表盘中命名路由"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:120
msgid ""
"A route's dashboard label defaults to its `kind`. Every provider-scoped "
"admin view (Token Usage, Provider Performance, Provider Observability, "
"the provider disable switch and the provider registry) groups on that "
"label, which `api_logs.provider` records. Two boxes both served as `kind:"
" vllm` therefore share one row. Give each route its own label, and "
"optionally a display name:"
msgstr ""
"路由的仪表盘标签默认是它的 `kind`。所有按 provider 划分的管理视图（Token Usage、Provider "
"Performance、Provider Observability、provider 禁用开关和 provider "
"注册表）都按这个标签分组，`api_logs.provider` 记录的也是它。因此两台都以 `kind: vllm` "
"提供服务的机器会共用一行。为每条路由设置各自的标签，还可以加上显示名称："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:149
msgid ""
"The dashboard then shows `Local box A · local-a` and `Local box B · "
"local-b` as separate providers, each with its own metrics and enable "
"switch. Only the label changes. The adapter, the server and the "
"[`endpoint_id`](glossary.md#routes-and-providers) (with its circuit "
"breaker, latency history and weight overrides) stay the same, and API "
"keys stay pooled under the kind, so one `LOCAL_API_KEY` serves both "
"boxes."
msgstr ""
"仪表盘随后会把 `Local box A · local-a` 和 `Local box B · local-b` 显示为两个独立的 "
"provider，各有自己的指标和启用开关。变化的只有标签。adapter、服务器和 [`endpoint_id`](glossary.md"
"#routes-and-providers)（连同它的熔断器、延迟历史和权重覆盖）都不变，API key 仍按 kind 汇入同一个池，所以一个 "
"`LOCAL_API_KEY` 就能服务两台机器。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:156
msgid ""
"A label is lowercase letters, digits, `-` or `_`, at most 64 characters, "
"and may not reuse a built-in provider's name (`vllm`, `zai`, "
"`openrouter`, …), which would merge its traffic into that provider's "
"reporting and disable switch. Admin refuses such a catalog. A stored one "
"registers no catalog model, and the backend logs `The model catalog "
"(MODEL_CATALOG in Admin > Providers > Models) was not registered: …`."
msgstr ""
"标签只能由小写字母、数字、`-` 或 `_` 组成，最多 64 个字符，并且不能使用内置 provider "
"的名称（`vllm`、`zai`、`openrouter` 等），否则它的流量会并入那个 provider 的统计和禁用开关。Admin "
"会拒绝这样的模型目录。如果已存储的目录中有这种标签，目录中的模型一个都不会注册，后端会记录 `The model catalog "
"(MODEL_CATALOG in Admin > Providers > Models) was not registered: …`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:162
msgid "`provider_display_name` alone renames a provider without splitting it."
msgstr "单独设置 `provider_display_name` 可以给 provider 改名，而不拆分它。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:163
msgid ""
"If a custom provider created in the Providers tab already uses the label,"
" it keeps its keys and target and the backend logs the clash as an error "
"at startup. Rename the label."
msgstr ""
"如果在 Providers 标签页中创建的自定义 provider 已经用了这个标签，它保留自己的 key "
"和目标地址，后端会在启动时把冲突记为错误。请给路由换一个标签。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:166
msgid ""
"Rows already written keep their old label until they age out of "
"`provider_hourly_stats` after 30 days, so charts show both labels for a "
"while."
msgstr "已经写入的记录保留旧标签，直到 30 天后从 `provider_hourly_stats` 中过期，所以图表会有一段时间同时显示两个标签。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:169
msgid "Step 3: Add a remote fallback (optional)"
msgstr "第 3 步：添加远程回退（可选）"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:171
msgid ""
"Add a second route with a small weight. With `0.01`, the fallback takes "
"about one request in a hundred first, plus every request that fails on "
"the local server. A route with weight `0` is never used, not even as a "
"fallback."
msgstr ""
"添加第二条权重很小的路由。权重为 `0.01` 时，回退路由大约会首先接收百分之一的请求，此外还会接收所有在本地服务器上失败的请求。权重为 `0`"
" 的路由永远不会使用，连回退也不会用。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:203
msgid ""
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.json` has a working local-first entry "
"built this way."
msgstr "`config/examples/models.openrouter.json` 中有一个按这种方式构建、可以直接使用的本地优先条目。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:206
msgid "Step 4: Verify through the gateway"
msgstr "第 4 步：通过网关验证"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:208
msgid "`GET /v1/models` answers without a key:"
msgstr "`GET /v1/models` 不需要 key："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:214
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` returns `401` without a gateway API key (the "
"key your gateway issued, not the local server's), unless the backend runs"
" with `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`:"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` 在没有网关 API key（网关签发的 key，不是本地服务器的）时返回 "
"`401`，除非后端以 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` 运行："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:231
msgid "Test streaming:"
msgstr "流式测试："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:245
msgid "A server on another machine"
msgstr "另一台机器上的服务器"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:247
msgid ""
"Keep a model server on another machine off the public internet, and point"
" the route at its private address:"
msgstr "不要把另一台机器上的模型服务器暴露到公网，让路由指向它的私有地址："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:264
msgid ""
"`deployment_type: self_hosted` marks the route as an engine you operate "
"even though its address is remote. It skips the provider-key concurrency "
"limit and lets a configured [engine queue limit](routing.md#engine-queue-"
"limit) apply to its streaming requests; it does not turn on queue offload"
" by itself. Inside a gateway container, `localhost` is the container, not"
" the model server."
msgstr ""
"`deployment_type: self_hosted` 表示这条路由指向你自己运营的引擎，即使地址在远程。它不受 provider key "
"并发限制，并让已配置的[引擎队列上限](routing.md#engine-queue-"
"limit)作用于它的流式请求；它本身不会开启队列卸载。在网关容器内，`localhost` 指的是容器本身，而不是模型服务器。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:270
msgid ""
"In **Admin → Routing** you can set the deployment type when you create or"
" repoint a route, or change it later. **Self-hosted engine** does not "
"skip the base URL checks. Changing the base URL or provider resets it to "
"**Auto** unless you choose again. If a saved override cannot be applied "
"at startup (its target no longer passes the base URL checks, say), the "
"route shows **Override not applied** until you edit it or reset its "
"config."
msgstr ""
"在 **Admin → Routing** 中，可以在创建或改指路由时设置部署类型，也可以之后再改。选择 **Self-hosted "
"engine** 并不会跳过 base URL 检查。修改 base URL 或 provider 会把它重置为 "
"**Auto**，除非你重新选择。如果已保存的覆盖在启动时无法应用（例如它的目标地址不再通过 base URL 检查），路由会显示 "
"**Override not applied**，直到你编辑它或重置它的配置。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:277
msgid ""
"You can also forward the port to the gateway host with an SSH reverse "
"tunnel, run on the model host:"
msgstr "也可以在模型主机上运行 SSH 反向隧道，把端口转发到网关主机："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:285
msgid ""
"The route then targets `http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1`. Check it from the "
"gateway host first:"
msgstr "这样路由的目标就是 `http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1`。先在网关主机上检查："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:292
msgid "Serving from an HPC cluster"
msgstr "从 HPC 集群提供模型"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:294
msgid ""
"On a cluster behind a batch scheduler (Slurm, PBS, LSF), each allocation "
"gives you a different compute node for a few hours. The node is usually "
"unreachable from the gateway and often cannot reach a container registry,"
" and the allocation costs money or queue priority while you hold it. So "
"the server binds the node's loopback, an SSH reverse tunnel carries it to"
" a fixed loopback port on the gateway host, and the route names that "
"port. A new allocation needs a new tunnel, never a catalog change."
msgstr ""
"在由批处理调度器（Slurm、PBS、LSF）管理的集群上，每次申请都会分到一个不同的计算节点，只能用几个小时。网关通常访问不到这个节点，节点往往也连不上容器镜像仓库，而且占用期间一直在花钱或消耗排队优先级。因此让服务器绑定节点的回环地址，用"
" SSH 反向隧道把它接到网关主机上一个固定的回环端口，路由指向这个端口。换一次申请只需要重开隧道，永远不用改模型目录。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:312
msgid ""
"Every scheduler flag, path and port below is a placeholder. Partitions, "
"GPU resource names, walltime limits and the container runtime differ per "
"site."
msgstr "下面的调度器参数、路径和端口都是占位符。分区、GPU 资源名称、运行时长上限和容器运行时因站点而异。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:315
msgid "1. Allocate a node"
msgstr "1\\. 申请节点"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:317
msgid "With Slurm:"
msgstr "使用 Slurm 时："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:328
msgid ""
"Note the job ID (to release the allocation) and the node name (to log "
"in). The node name changes with every allocation, so never put it in the "
"catalog."
msgstr "记下作业 ID（用于释放申请）和节点名称（用于登录）。节点名称每次申请都会变，所以不要把它写进模型目录。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:336
msgid "2. Make the container image available offline"
msgstr "2\\. 让容器镜像可以离线使用"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:338
msgid ""
"Compute nodes often have no outbound network. Pull the image where there "
"is network, save it to shared storage and load it on the node. Pin an "
"exact tag or digest, not `:latest`, so every load is the same image:"
msgstr ""
"计算节点通常没有出站网络。在有网络的地方拉取镜像，保存到共享存储，再在节点上加载。固定准确的标签或摘要，不要用 "
"`:latest`，这样每次加载的都是同一个镜像："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:353
msgid "`docker save` and `docker load` take the same arguments."
msgstr "`docker save` 和 `docker load` 接受相同的参数。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:355
msgid "3. Start the model server"
msgstr "3\\. 启动模型服务器"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:373
msgid ""
"`--publish 127.0.0.1:8000:8000` keeps the server off the cluster network."
" A bare `-p 8000:8000` exposes it, unauthenticated, to every machine on "
"the fabric."
msgstr ""
"`--publish 127.0.0.1:8000:8000` 让服务器不暴露到集群网络上。直接写 `-p 8000:8000` "
"会把它在没有任何认证的情况下暴露给集群网络上的每一台机器。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:376
msgid ""
"`--host 0.0.0.0` is the container's interface. Binding `127.0.0.1` inside"
" the container would leave the published port answering nothing."
msgstr "`--host 0.0.0.0` 指的是容器的网络接口。如果在容器内绑定 `127.0.0.1`，发布出来的端口将不会有任何响应。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:378
msgid "`--tensor-parallel-size` must equal the number of GPUs in the allocation."
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size` 必须等于申请到的 GPU 数量。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:379
msgid ""
"`--ipc=host` gives vLLM's workers enough shared memory. Where your site "
"forbids it, set a large `--shm-size`."
msgstr "`--ipc=host` 让 vLLM 的 worker 有足够的共享内存。如果站点禁止这样做，就设置一个较大的 `--shm-size`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:381
msgid ""
"`--device nvidia.com/gpu=all` is Podman's CDI syntax; Docker uses `--gpus"
" all`. `:Z` relabels the volume for SELinux; drop it where SELinux is not"
" enforced."
msgstr ""
"`--device nvidia.com/gpu=all` 是 Podman 的 CDI 写法；Docker 使用 `--gpus "
"all`。`:Z` 为 SELinux 重新标记卷；没有启用 SELinux 时去掉它。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:384
msgid ""
"`--served-model-name` becomes your `provider_model_id`. Without it, the "
"model is named by its `--model` path."
msgstr "`--served-model-name` 就是你的 `provider_model_id`。不设置时，模型以 `--model` 的路径命名。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:387
msgid "Check it on the node:"
msgstr "在节点上检查："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:393
msgid "4. Tunnel it to the gateway host"
msgstr "4\\. 用隧道接到网关主机"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:395
msgid "From the compute node, open the tunnel and record its PID:"
msgstr "在计算节点上打开隧道并记下它的 PID："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:411
msgid ""
"Bind the remote end to `127.0.0.1`. `-R 0.0.0.0:8001:...` would publish "
"an unauthenticated model server on every network of the gateway host; it "
"also needs `GatewayPorts yes` in that host's `sshd`, which is safer left "
"off."
msgstr ""
"把远端绑定到 `127.0.0.1`。`-R 0.0.0.0:8001:...` "
"会把一个没有认证的模型服务器发布到网关主机所在的每个网络上；它还需要该主机的 `sshd` 设置 `GatewayPorts "
"yes`，而这个选项保持关闭更安全。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:414
msgid ""
"With `ExitOnForwardFailure=yes`, the tunnel fails if port 8001 is still "
"held by a previous allocation's tunnel. That process runs on the gateway "
"host, so clear it there:"
msgstr ""
"设置 `ExitOnForwardFailure=yes` 后，如果 8001 "
"端口仍被上一次申请的隧道占用，隧道会直接失败。占用它的进程运行在网关主机上，所以要在那里清理："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:423
msgid ""
"The tunnel ends with the allocation. `autossh`, a systemd user unit or a "
"retry loop rides out network blips, but nothing survives the job ending."
msgstr "隧道会随申请一起结束。`autossh`、systemd 用户单元或重试循环可以扛过网络抖动，但作业结束后什么都留不下。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:426
msgid "Check from the gateway host, where the gateway resolves it:"
msgstr "在网关主机上检查，网关就是在这里解析这个地址的："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:432
msgid "5. Register the route"
msgstr "5\\. 注册路由"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:434
msgid ""
"Register the model as in [Step 2](#step-2-register-the-model), with "
"`http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1` as `base_url` and your `--served-model-name` "
"as `provider_model_id`."
msgstr ""
"按[第 2 步](#step-2-register-the-model)注册模型，`base_url` 设为 "
"`http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1`，`provider_model_id` 设为你的 `--served-model-"
"name`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:438
msgid "6. Release everything when you are done"
msgstr "6\\. 用完后释放所有资源"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:440
msgid ""
"Otherwise the job keeps burning walltime, the route points at a closed "
"port, and a stale listener on the gateway host breaks the next tunnel."
msgstr "否则作业会继续消耗运行时长，路由会指向一个已关闭的端口，网关主机上残留的监听还会让下一次的隧道失败。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:443
msgid ""
"Disable the route in **Admin → Routing**, so traffic stops before the "
"port closes."
msgstr "在 **Admin → Routing** 中禁用路由，让流量在端口关闭之前停下。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:445
msgid "On the compute node, close the tunnel and stop the server:"
msgstr "在计算节点上关闭隧道并停止服务器："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:452
msgid ""
"Release the allocation: exit the `salloc` shell, or from the login node "
"run `scancel <job-id>`."
msgstr "释放申请：退出 `salloc` shell，或者在登录节点上运行 `scancel <job-id>`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:454
msgid ""
"From the gateway host, confirm the port is free. This should now fail to "
"connect:"
msgstr "在网关主机上确认端口已释放。现在这条命令应该连接失败："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:461
msgid "Showing the queue in the admin console"
msgstr "在管理控制台中查看队列"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:463
msgid ""
"A host that starts a model's job only when the model is requested answers"
" `503` with error code `model_queued` while the job waits. Interactive "
"callers get that answer and batch requests wait; neither counts against "
"the endpoint's circuit. A request that runs longer than the proxy waits "
"for one answer gets `504` with `upstream_timeout`. The caller sees it, "
"but it does not count against the circuit either, so one caller's long "
"generations cannot shut the model off for everyone."
msgstr ""
"只在有人请求模型时才启动作业的主机，在作业排队期间会返回带错误码 `model_queued` 的 "
"`503`。交互式调用方收到这个响应，批处理请求则等待；两者都不计入端点的熔断。运行时间超过代理单次等待时长的请求会得到带 "
"`upstream_timeout` 的 `504`。调用方会看到它，但它同样不计入熔断，所以一个调用方的长时间生成不会让所有人都用不了这个模型。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:471
msgid "To see the queue, have the proxy publish its status and give the gateway the address in **Admin → Settings → Providers → Advanced settings**:"
msgstr "要查看队列，让代理发布自己的状态，并在 **Admin → Settings → Providers → Advanced settings** 中把地址告诉网关："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md
msgid "`MODEL_QUEUE_STATUS_URL`"
msgstr "`MODEL_QUEUE_STATUS_URL`"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md
msgid ""
"The status address as the backend reaches it, for example "
"`http://host.docker.internal:8010/status`"
msgstr "后端访问到的状态地址，例如 `http://host.docker.internal:8010/status`"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md
msgid "`MODEL_QUEUE_STATUS_API_KEY`"
msgstr "`MODEL_QUEUE_STATUS_API_KEY`"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md
msgid "Bearer key for that address; empty sends `LOCAL_API_KEY`"
msgstr "访问该地址用的 bearer key；为空时发送 `LOCAL_API_KEY`"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:479
msgid ""
"**Admin → Batches → Model queue** then lists each model the proxy serves,"
" with its state and jobs, the gateway models routed to it and the batch "
"requests waiting for them. A route belongs to the proxy when its "
"`base_url` has the status address's scheme, host and port. The gateway "
"follows no redirect from the address, and reports a failure on the page "
"instead of failing requests."
msgstr ""
"之后 **Admin → Batches → Model queue** "
"会列出代理提供的每个模型，包括它的状态和作业、路由到它的网关模型，以及正在等待这些模型的批处理请求。路由的 `base_url` 与状态地址的 "
"scheme、主机和端口相同时，就算作该代理的路由。网关不会跟随该地址的重定向，出错时在页面上报告，而不会让请求失败。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:485
msgid ""
"The status is a JSON object with times in epoch seconds. Each model needs"
" only `model` (the name the proxy serves it under) and `state` "
"(`serving`, `loading`, `queued` or `idle`); other fields are optional, "
"and unknown ones are ignored:"
msgstr ""
"状态是一个 JSON 对象，时间均为 Unix 秒。每个模型只需要 `model`（代理提供它时使用的名称）和 "
"`state`（`serving`、`loading`、`queued` 或 `idle`）；其他字段可选，未知字段会被忽略："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:519
msgid ""
"`refreshed_at` is when the proxy last read the scheduler's queue. A "
"running job's `nodes`, `started_at` and `ends_at` describe it; "
"`expected_start_at` is the scheduler's estimate for a pending job."
msgstr ""
"`refreshed_at` 是代理最近一次读取调度器队列的时间。运行中的作业用 `nodes`、`started_at` 和 `ends_at`"
" 描述；`expected_start_at` 是调度器对排队作业开始时间的估计。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:523
msgid "Server-specific settings"
msgstr "与服务器相关的设置"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:525
msgid "Prioritizing decode on an sglang route"
msgstr "在 sglang 路由上优先保障解码"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:527
msgid ""
"If an sglang server was started with `--enable-priority-scheduling`, set "
"`priority_scheduling: true` on its route. The gateway then gives each "
"request a `priority`, so a huge prefill is scheduled behind interactive "
"traffic:"
msgstr ""
"如果 sglang 服务器以 `--enable-priority-scheduling` 启动，就在它的路由上设置 "
"`priority_scheduling: true`。网关会为每个请求设置 `priority`，让超大的预填充排在交互式流量之后："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:553
msgid ""
"The priority comes from the estimated *uncached* prefill: the prompt size"
" minus the prefix this endpoint probably has cached. The tiers are "
"interactive 20, large 15 and elephant 0, and a client's own `priority` "
"field is dropped. Both `/v1/chat/completions` and `/v1/messages` set it. "
"Models on `router: routewise` keep the upstream default, so the flag does"
" nothing there. Set it only for servers started with the flag: a remote "
"provider that validates its request body strictly may reject the field."
msgstr ""
"优先级由估算的*未命中缓存*的预填充量决定：提示词大小减去该端点很可能已缓存的前缀。三个档位分别是 interactive 20、large 15"
" 和 elephant 0，客户端自己带的 `priority` 字段会被丢弃。`/v1/chat/completions` 和 "
"`/v1/messages` 都会设置它。使用 `router: routewise` "
"的模型保持上游的默认优先级，所以这个开关在那里不起作用。只对以该参数启动的服务器设置它：严格校验请求体的远程 provider "
"可能会拒绝这个字段。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:561
msgid "Recording a prefix-cache miss on an sglang route"
msgstr "在 sglang 路由上记录前缀缓存未命中"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:563
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"sglang with `--enable-cache-report` answers a prefix-cache miss with "
"`\"prompt_tokens_details\": null` instead of `{\"cached_tokens\": 0}`. "
"The gateway stores that null as `NULL` in `api_logs.cache_read_tokens`, "
"as for a provider that cannot report, so measured misses drop out of hit-"
"rate calculations. Declare on the route that the server reports, and the "
"null is stored as `0`:"
msgstr ""
"带 `--enable-cache-report` 的 sglang 在前缀缓存未命中时返回 "
"`\"prompt_tokens_details\": null`，而不是 `{\"cached_tokens\": 0}`。网关会把这个 "
"null 在 `api_logs.cache_read_tokens` 中存为 `NULL`，与无法报告缓存的 provider "
"一样，于是实测的未命中会从命中率计算中消失。在路由上声明该服务器会报告缓存，这个 null 就会存为 `0`："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:585
msgid ""
"**Verify before setting it.** sglang without `--enable-cache-report`, and"
" vLLM without `--enable-prompt-tokens-details`, send the same null on "
"every request, hit or miss ([vllm-project/vllm#44377](https://github.com"
"/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44377)). There the flag would record every "
"request as a miss. Send the same fresh, long prompt twice:"
msgstr ""
"**设置之前先验证**。没有 `--enable-cache-report` 的 sglang，以及没有 `--enable-prompt-"
"tokens-details` 的 vLLM，无论命中与否，每个请求都返回同样的 null（[vllm-"
"project/vllm#44377](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm/issues/44377)）。在这些服务器上设置这个开关，会把每个请求都记为未命中。把同一个新生成的长提示词发送两次："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:595
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The route qualifies only if the first call returns `null` and the second "
"`{\"cached_tokens\": N}` with `N > 0`. The flag is allowed only on a "
"route, and only as a real boolean: a quoted `\"false\"` is a "
"configuration error."
msgstr ""
"只有第一次返回 `null`、第二次返回 `N > 0` 的 `{\"cached_tokens\": N}` "
"时，这条路由才符合条件。这个开关只能写在路由上，而且必须是真正的布尔值：带引号的 `\"false\"` 属于配置错误。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:599
msgid "Media URLs on a self-hosted route"
msgstr "自托管路由上的媒体 URL"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:601
msgid ""
"vLLM and SGLang download any image, video or audio URL in a request from "
"the machine they run on. On a self-hosted route the gateway fetches those"
" URLs itself and sends the engine a `data:` URL, so a caller cannot make "
"your server read addresses on its own network. A route is self-hosted "
"with `deployment_type: self_hosted`, or under `auto` when its host is a "
"loopback or Docker-host address. Declare it for an engine on a LAN "
"address, which `auto` treats as a provider API."
msgstr ""
"vLLM 和 SGLang 会在它们所在的机器上下载请求中的任何图像、视频或音频 URL。在自托管路由上，网关会自己获取这些 URL，再以 "
"`data:` URL 发给引擎，这样调用方就无法让你的服务器访问它所在网络中的地址。设置了 `deployment_type: "
"self_hosted` 的路由属于自托管；在 `auto` 下，主机为回环地址或 Docker "
"宿主机地址的路由也属于自托管。局域网地址上的引擎要显式声明，因为 `auto` 会把它当作 provider API。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:609
msgid ""
"The gateway fetches only `http` and `https` URLs on public addresses, up "
"to 20 MiB per file and 32 MiB per request within 30 seconds; anything "
"else gets a `400` that names the message and part. It needs outbound "
"internet access and does not use an HTTP proxy. `data:` URLs pass "
"through, and provider routes forward URLs unchanged."
msgstr ""
"网关只获取公网地址上的 `http` 和 `https` URL，每个文件最多 20 MiB，每个请求最多 32 MiB，限时 30 "
"秒；其他情况返回 `400`，并指出是哪条消息的哪个部分。这需要出站互联网访问，且不经过 HTTP 代理。`data:` URL "
"原样通过，provider 路由则照常转发 URL。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:615
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:617
msgid ""
"**Model missing from `/v1/models`.** See [Troubleshooting](adding-"
"models.md#troubleshooting) for the startup log lines to check."
msgstr ""
"**模型没有出现在 `/v1/models` 中**。要检查的启动日志见[故障排查](adding-"
"models.md#troubleshooting)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:621
msgid "**Gateway cannot reach the server.**"
msgstr "**网关无法访问服务器**。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:623
msgid "From Docker, use `host.docker.internal`, not `localhost`."
msgstr "在 Docker 中使用 `host.docker.internal`，而不是 `localhost`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:624
msgid ""
"A server reached from a container must listen on `0.0.0.0`, not only "
"`127.0.0.1`."
msgstr "需要从容器访问的服务器必须监听 `0.0.0.0`，不能只监听 `127.0.0.1`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:626
msgid "Run `curl <base_url>/v1/models` from the same environment as the backend."
msgstr "在与后端相同的环境中运行 `curl <base_url>/v1/models`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:628
msgid "**Requests fail after registration.**"
msgstr "**注册后请求失败**。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:630
msgid "`provider_model_id` must match the name the runtime serves."
msgstr "`provider_model_id` 必须与运行时提供的名称一致。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:631
msgid "Drop parameters the runtime rejects from `supported_params`."
msgstr "从 `supported_params` 中去掉运行时不接受的参数。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:632
msgid ""
"Set `supports_tools` and `supports_structured_output` only if the runtime"
" supports them."
msgstr "只有运行时支持时才设置 `supports_tools` 和 `supports_structured_output`。"

